{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> of positive integers are solutions to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b2ff9a97cace9c87b796af5a6dac9a8551413d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4}{m}+\\frac{2}{n}=1?\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219349ce05ca42337a077e3858d7de33d35ea626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 1\\quad \\text{(B) } 2\\quad \\text{(C) } 3\\quad \\text{(D) } 4\\quad \\text{(E) } \\text{more than }6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"344\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150c08478d63c3d2f5cc0de4222ea9183673d7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn$\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" /> to clear the denominator. Moving all the terms to the right hand side, the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/05322a3f707ec3312d9ecc6ca6f4a4fd15fb6b95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = mn-4n-2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"149\" height=\"13\" />. Adding 8 to both sides allows us to factor the equation as follows: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/21203750d3f850c66ae5d950a14816aa5d38dc1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-4)(n-2) = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />. Since the problem only wants integer pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" />, the pairs are given by the factors of 8, which are 1,2,4, and 8. This results in four pairs, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a462c31ebeb11faff7b0ceceee46dcc84a1ef69b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,10), (6,6), (8,4),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/461e8b9accdf5a8fc965682891b8ba01ad65de1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />, which is answer \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Pr